<h4 id="Explanation"><strong>Explanation</strong><a class="anchor-link" href="#Explanation">¶</a></h4><ol>
<li>Calculates and displays the mean summary statistics of all numerical variables for each cluster formed by K-Means.</li>
<li>Calculates and displays the mean summary statistics of all numerical variables for each cluster formed by DBSCAN.</li>
<li>Calculates and displays the mean summary statistics of all numerical variables for each cluster formed by Agglomerative Clustering.</li>
<li>The groupby() function groups the dataframe based on each clustering result (KMeans_Cluster, DBSCAN_Cluster, and Agglomerative_Cluster).</li>
<li>The mean() function computes the average values for each variable within each detected cluster.</li>
<li>These summaries help in understanding the characteristics of each cluster, such as which clusters have higher or lower averages for specific features.</li>
</ol>
